      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive sales floor with mixed encounters"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many customers describe helpful and friendly interactions with cashiers and sales floor associates who assist in locating pet supplies and nutrition deals. Conversely, several reviewers express frustration with dismissive attitudes in the aquatics department, long waits for assistance, or unhelpful management responses."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Convenient layout alongside inventory gaps"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers appreciate the convenient location on FM 1960 West and generally find the store organized and easy to browse for dog and cat supplies. However, multiple reviewers report recurring out-of-stock items, empty shelves for specific pet foods, and discrepancies between online inventory listings and physical store stock."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Broad selection of pet supplies"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight the wide variety of supplies available for dogs, cats, birds, and aquatic pets, ranging from quality treats and specialized diets to aquarium accessories. Reviewers frequently note coming in for regular pet treats or habitat supplies and finding suitable options for their companion animals."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Petco on FM 1960 West offer curbside pickup?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, online order pickup is available, though some reviewers suggest heading inside to the register if curbside response times are slow."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are pet grooming services offered at this store?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the store includes a full-service grooming salon for dog baths, haircuts, and nail trims, though appointment availability varies."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What specialty sections are featured in the store?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Customers frequently visit the dedicated aquatics section for fish and aquarium supplies, alongside bird and small animal departments."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    }
